    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's good but it needs to be even more blunt. some people try to argue that coal is necessary for jobs or energy stability, but that's basically just a lie to keep the profits flowing, right? can you add a section that shuts down those excuses and explains why their economic arguments are just wrong?",
